d $y.$ This means that the slope varies with both $x$ and $y.$\n\nOf the given slope fields, the only one that varies with both $x$ and $y$ is the following:\n\n![](images/74/749132341c79056904d68e444249b5ad33e89df84700c5756ca8c8a1246f033f.png)\n\n \n\nTo see this more clearly, notice that if we draw a vertical line and a horizontal line, the slopes vary if we move along either of the two lines.\n\n![](images/17/170a2afad1f143ccce8776f20b810096c7b127782543278671ad9794aecb391e.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186672661 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f6123c2-455c-5236-b708-ceb735e2ed80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f5/f58b76d8b0a4f9687f30d23227d03982d97b7467a3389749633e2ab92c1fb419.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672655} {:answer/id #uuid "979f43b5-94cc-5aca-95b6-20f35dd6f900" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/20/2001bcc57f69aa456ebddb97c8e9cf323e11af1565f85eab09f353a19d68f007.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672673} {:answer/id #uuid "a35b6266-7651-5ef8-b781-3f63d87c3f01" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/43/43d8cc77fa0e6b149b8e8653e6a1ce25a403bf5b9fda0a70d2299f5d48b58d05.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672675} {:answer/id #uuid "b0d268e6-66fe-5d02-a582-599ca3883dc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f0/f0430c1209d30d5f1b554c571ed3ce145a1f9f7654b74fdf75173536993b26c4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672679} {:answer/id #uuid "fe868539-bdd8-521e-aa71-953921aef1d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/84/84aa74afe6fc14f57f01f96080d961a09a3063d5beaf6cde311f5ba29c2b31be.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672687}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b0d268e6-66fe-5d02-a582-599ca3883dc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/f0/f0430c1209d30d5f1b554c571ed3ce145a1f9f7654b74fdf75173536993b26c4.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186672679} :answer-field/id #uuid "67e4d9e9-0642-5d